Package: winship
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Shark Wan <178453051+shark-wan@users.noreply.github.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: adduser, initramfs-tools, libc6, libvirt-clients, libvirt-daemon-system, ovmf, pkexec, polkitd, qemu-system-x86, qemu-utils, xdg-utils
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Description: Local web manager for one Windows VM with PCI passthrough
 Winship manages a single local Windows virtual machine on Debian using
 QEMU, libvirt, OVMF, VFIO, and VirtIO Balloon. It runs a token-protected
 local web interface and includes a PolicyKit helper for applying VFIO
 host configuration.
